        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><img alt=\"Alliance\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/25/Alliance_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620204931\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lord Candren</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/8/88/Lord_Candren.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20151030115827\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lord Candren\"><img alt=\"Image of Lord Candren\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/8/88/Lord_Candren.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/151?cb=20151030115827\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"151\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lord Candren.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Candren.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Title</th><td>\n&lt;Gilneas Quartermaster&gt;</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n60</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(faction)\" title=\"Gilneas (faction)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Occupation</th><td>\nVendor</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Temple_Gardens\" title=\"Temple Gardens\">Temple Gardens</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Darnassus\" title=\"Darnassus\">Darnassus</a><span><span class=\"tttemplatelink coords-link noexcerpt\" data-coords=\"/way 37 47\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darnassus\" title=\"Darnassus\"><sup>[37,&#160;47]</sup></a></span><span style=\"display:none;\"><span class=\"ZoneMap\" style=\"position:relative;width:300px;height:200px;display:block\"><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/3/3a/WorldMap-Darnassus.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20190616154614\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"WorldMap-Darnassus.jpg\" data-image-key=\"WorldMap-Darnassus.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:37%;top:47%;line-height:0;margin:-5.5px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blip.png\" data-image-key=\"Blip.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/f4/Blip.png/revision/latest?cb=20101220042049\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nAlive</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Candren</b> is the <a href=\"/wiki/Quartermaster\" title=\"Quartermaster\">quartermaster</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(faction)\" title=\"Gilneas (faction)\">Gilneas</a>. He is found in <a href=\"/wiki/Darnassus\" title=\"Darnassus\">Darnassus</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Temple_Gardens\" title=\"Temple Gardens\">Temple Gardens</a>, near the <a href=\"/wiki/Flight_master\" title=\"Flight master\">flight master</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Battle_for_Azeroth\" title=\"Battle for Azeroth\"><img alt=\"Battle for Azeroth\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BattleForAzeroth-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"BattleForAzeroth-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c1/BattleForAzeroth-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/48?cb=20220421181442\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to <i><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Battle_for_Azeroth\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Battle for Azeroth\">Battle for Azeroth</a></i>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>Lord Candren survived the <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_of_Teldrassil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burning of Teldrassil\">Burning of Teldrassil</a> and made his way to <a href=\"/wiki/Stormwind_Embassy\" title=\"Stormwind Embassy\">Stormwind Embassy</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vendor_information\">Vendor information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"darktable\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\">\n<caption>\n\n</caption>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/90/Inv_misc_cape_18.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019234138\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Inv misc cape 18\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv misc cape 18.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_misc_cape_18.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/90/Inv_misc_cape_18.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/32?cb=20061019234138\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"middle\"><span class=\"itemlink\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cape_of_Gilneas\" title=\"Cape of Gilneas\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink qc-rare\" title=\"Cape of Gilneas# is a rare quality item.\"><span class=\"bracket\">&#91;</span>Cape of Gilneas<span class=\"bracket\">&#93;</span></span></a></span><br /><span class=\"nobreak ajaxoutertt\">1<span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Money#Types_of_coins\" title=\"g\"><img alt=\"g\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-elem